{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24518","headline":"晚池泛舟遇景成咏赠吕处士 · 白居易","name":"晚池泛舟遇景成咏赠吕处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岸浅桥平池面宽，飘然轻櫂泛澄澜。\n风宜扇引开怀入，树爱舟行仰卧看。\n别境客稀知不易，能诗人少咏应难。\n唯怜吕叟时相伴，同把磻溪旧钓竿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}